@display("std/http")
http: part {
  | Binds apis and ops to HTTP, with server-sent events for streamed results.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/http/package.heron`, whose types the API
  | reference renders; each export is specified where its behaviour is:
  |
  | | Export                                                | Specified in                                            |
  | | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |
  | | `@get`, `@post`, `@put`, `@patch`, `@delete`, `@http` | [Transports](#language.apis.transports)                 |
  | | `@path`, `@query`, `@header`, `@body`                 | [Params](#language.apis.params)                         |
  | | `@status`                                             | [Responses](#language.apis.responses.status_annotation) |
}
